{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>歌手衛蘭（Janice）於紅館舉行四場的《衛蘭 OUT OF FRAME世界巡迴演唱會》，今日（18日）迎來尾場演出。除了JW是嘉賓外，陳奕迅亦是嘉賓之一，Eason一出場在場觀眾立即歡呼。</p><p>Eason一出場就與Janice合唱《講男講女》，唱完後Eason表示很欣賞Janice，還大爆之前所選的並原是這首歌，而是另一首英文歌，他還笑指二人平時是以英文對答。</p><p>另外，難得請到Eason做嘉賓，Janice立即代現場觀眾請Eason多唱一首。她表示這歌自己在電視台曾唱過，Eason即笑指：「依家你同原唱唱。」說完二人便合唱《K歌之王》。</p><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝影）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1199878135525675008185470.jpeg/T15jlm5Zm-dGeLuvpykVBWhpdgnIZl-QFxjmHxcY5h8\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝影）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝影）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1199878132706971648032185.jpeg/9maHQw5xxEVHbNYQPSutwoAXIEL3y3a9EbKQpRGykKU\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝影）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（葉志明 攝影）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1199878130026680320127586.jpeg/r_s2m0Ahq3JXfg82QNTHQk3JWQkl2h_EPQ0GtD0NBrQ\"/><figcaption>（葉志明 攝影）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T16:24:39.417050+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":296,"images":3,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T16:13:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T16:38:04.433758+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T16:17:58.860025+00:00","content_hash":"c62798a834a229bfaf6f22acc2f2f1044ffe06537ab64f4540c82d96be74d8fa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}